ats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-4cf6efaa507b2b99END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-52601bb3b37e1a20END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_BOOK_LOW_BasiliskGate_BattlefieldReport</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_BasiliskGate_BattlefieldReport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_BasiliskGate_BattlefieldReport\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">23fc188f-cce7-41df-a64c-3db3fb37a586</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:23fc188f-cce7-41df-a64c-3db3fb37a586\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:23fc188f-cce7-41df-a64c-3db3fb37a586\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a desk in <a href=\"/wiki/Heapside_Prison\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Heapside Prison\">Heapside Prison</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1286&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;776</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[This dirty note appears to have been sent in haste from the battlefield.]\n</p><p><br>\nSteel Watch invaluable. Absolute troops numerous, fierce, but less disciplined. Cannot keep them from the city indefinitely, but Steel Watch will buy us time.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714215354\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1351/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23814/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5660/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931069/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.257      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   44.257      1 -total\n 44.09%   19.514      6 Template:Icon_text\n 39.20%   17.351     15 Template:Trim\n 24.08%   10.655      1 Template:Main_only\n 21.40%    9.471      2 Template:Uid\n 12.40%    5.488      2 Template:Template_style\n  9.32%    4.124      1 Template:Notes\n  9.07%    4.016      1 Template:PageSeo\n  8.85%    3.915      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:34905-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714215354 and revision id 394203. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}